    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Fiscal Deficit = Total Expenditure - Total Receipts excluding borrowings.",
        "Primary Deficit = Fiscal Deficit - Interest Payments.",
        "Distinguish clearly between Revenue Expenditure (routine administrative costs) and Capital Expenditure (infrastructure and asset creation).",
        "Direct Tax vs. Indirect Tax classification under Revenue Receipts is frequently tested."
      ],
